WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.243
Here's the easiest way to learn Arabic: open the app, and press Continue.

2
00:00:05.943 --> 00:00:08.432
[Rafiq] This is رَفِيق. Let me show you everything inside.

3
00:00:09.132 --> 00:00:15.114
First, your journey. One path: a reading starter, then twelve units, from greetings to hobbies.

4
00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:23.447
Each step takes five to ten minutes. Meet new words, hear a conversation, learn one grammar idea, practise, then speak.

5
00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:29.726
In the early units, you build sentences from word tiles. Later on, you type them yourself.

6
00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:34.077
أَذْهَبُ إِلى الْمَدْرَسَةِ بِالْحافِلَةِ كُلَّ يَوْمٍ — I go to school by bus every day.

7
00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:38.906
[Rafiq] And رَفِيق brings every word back for review, just before you'd forget it.

8
00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:43.387
Want something specific? Step off the path, into Practise.

9
00:00:44.088 --> 00:00:47.783
Drill twenty-one common verbs in the past, present and future.

10
00:00:48.483 --> 00:00:51.380
Learn the joining words that link your ideas together.

11
00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:55.448
أُصَلِّي، ثُمَّ أَتَناوَلُ الْفَطُورَ. — I pray, then I have breakfast.

12
00:00:56.248 --> 00:00:59.598
Or play the spelling bee: hear a word, then spell it in Arabic.

13
00:00:59.998 --> 00:01:01.070
كِتاب — book

14
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.806
Go further with Complete. Practise real-life scenes, from the airport to the masjid.

15
00:01:09.606 --> 00:01:12.996
السَّلامُ عَلَيْكُمْ. أَنا جارُكَ الْجَدِيدُ. — Peace be upon you. I'm your new neighbour.

16
00:01:13.396 --> 00:01:17.041
Have the conversation yourself, and get feedback on every reply.

17
00:01:18.341 --> 00:01:21.378
And get a review built from the mistakes you keep making.

18
00:01:22.378 --> 00:01:25.692
Your journey, or something specific. A few minutes a day.

19
00:01:26.192 --> 00:01:27.957
[Rafiq] Try رَفِيق free today.
